#: kcmaccess.cpp:199
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, the default system bell will be used. See the "
"\"System Bell\" control module for how to customize the system bell. "
"Normally, this is just a \"beep\"."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:202
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Check this option if you want to use a customized bell, playing a sound "
"file. If you do this, you will probably want to turn off the system bell.</"
"p><p> Please note that on slow machines this may cause a \"lag\" between the "
"event causing the bell and the sound being played.</p>"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:210
#, kde-format
msgid "Sound &to play:"
msgstr "बजाएल जाएबला ध्वनि. (&t)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "ब्राउज करू..."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:216
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the option \"Use customized bell\" is enabled, you can choose a sound "
"file here. Click \"Browse...\" to choose a sound file using the file dialog."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:233
#, kde-format
msgid "Visible Bell"
msgstr "दृश्यमय घंटी"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use visible bell"
msgstr "दृश्यमय घंटी प्रयोग करू (&U)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:243
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This option will turn on the \"visible bell\", i.e. a visible notification "
"shown every time that normally just a bell would occur. This is especially "
"useful for deaf people."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:250
#, kde-format
msgid "I&nvert screen"
msgstr "स्क्रीन उनटू (&n)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:254
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"All screen colors will be inverted for the amount of time specified below."
msgstr "सभटा स्क्रीन रंग बताएल समय क' लेल उनट जएताह."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid "F&lash screen"
msgstr "स्क्रीन फ्लैश करू (&l)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:258
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The screen will turn to a custom color for the amount of time specified "
"below."
msgstr "स्क्रीन रंग बताएल समय क' लेल मनपसिन्न रंगक भए जाएत."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:264
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Click here to choose the color used for the \"flash screen\" visible bell."
msgstr "\"फ्लैश स्क्रीन\" दृश्यमय घंटी क' लेल उपयोग मे आबैवला रंग चुनबाक लेल एतय क्लिक करू."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:274
#, kde-format
msgid "Duration:"
msgstr "अवधिः"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:275 kcmaccess.cpp:389 kcmaccess.cpp:429
#, kde-format
msgid " msec"
msgstr "मि.से."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:277
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the \"visible bell\" effect being "
"shown."
msgstr ""
"एतए अहाँ \"दृश्यमय घंटी\" केर प्रभाव जे देखाओल जाइछ, ओकर अवधि मनपसिन्न कए सकैत छी."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:294
#, kde-format
msgid "&Bell"
msgstr "घंटी (&B)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:302
#, kde-format
msgid "S&ticky Keys"
msgstr "सटल कुंजीसभ (&t)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:310
#, kde-format
msgid "Use &sticky keys"
msgstr "सटल कुंजीसभक इस्तेमाल करू (&s)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:316
#, kde-format
msgid "&Lock sticky keys"
msgstr "सटल कुंजीसभक तालाबन्न करू (&L)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgid "Turn sticky keys off when two keys are pressed simultaneously"
msgstr "जखन दुइ कुंजीसभ केँ एके सँग दबाएल जाए तँ सटल कुंजीसभक अक्षम करू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:328
#, kde-format
msgid "Use system bell whenever a modifier gets latched, locked or unlocked"
msgstr "जखन कोनो माडीफायर लैच, तालाबंद अथवा ताला खोलल जाइछ अछि तँ तंत्र घंटी बजाबू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgid "Locking Keys"
msgstr "लाकिंग कुंजीसभ"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:339
#, kde-format
msgid "Use system bell whenever a locking key gets activated or deactivated"
msgstr "जखन कोनो तालाबंद कुँजी सक्रिय अथवा अक्रिय कएल जाइछ तँ तंत्र घंटी बजाबू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:342
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a modifier or locking key "
"changes its state"
msgstr ""
"जखन माडीफायर अथवा तालाबन्न कुँजी अपन स्थिति बदलैत अछि तँ केडीई तंत्र सूचना सेवाक इस्तेमाल "
"करू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:348 kcmaccess.cpp:515
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure &Notifications..."
msgstr "सूचनासभ बिन्यस्त करू.... (&N)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:365
#, kde-format
msgid "&Modifier Keys"
msgstr "परिवर्धक कुंजीसभ (&M)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:371
#, kde-format
msgid "Slo&w Keys"
msgstr "धीमा कुंजीसभ (&w)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:379
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use slow keys"
msgstr "धीमा कुंजीसभक इस्तेमाल करू (&U)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:390
#, kde-format
msgid "Acceptance dela&y:"
msgstr "स्वीकारब मे देरी (&y):"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:396
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is pressed"
msgstr "जखन कोनो कुँजी दबाएल जाए तँ तंत्र घंटी क' इस्तेमाल करू (&U)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:402
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is accepted"
msgstr "जखन कोनो कुँजी स्वीकारल तँ तंत्र घंटी क' इस्तेमाल करू (&U)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:408
#, kde-format
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "जखन कोनो कुँजी अस्वीकारल तँ तंत्र घंटी क' इस्तेमाल करू (&U)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:411
#, kde-format
msgid "Bounce Keys"
msgstr "उछलैत कुंजीसभ"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:419
#, kde-format
msgid "Use bou&nce keys"
msgstr "उछलैत कुंजीसभ इस्तेमाल करू (&n)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:430
#, kde-format
msgid "D&ebounce time:"
msgstr "डिबाउन्स समय (&e):"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:436
#, kde-format
msgid "Use the system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "जखन कोनो कुँजी अस्वीकारल जाए तँ तंत्र घंटीक इस्तेमाल करू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:454
#, kde-format
msgid "&Keyboard Filters"
msgstr "कुंजीपटलक फिल्टर (&K)"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:461 kcmaccess.cpp:531
#, kde-format
msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgstr "सक्रियणक मुद्रा"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:469
#, kde-format
msgid "Use gestures for activating sticky keys and slow keys"
msgstr "उपरोक्त विशेषतासभ केँ सक्रिय करब क' लेल मुद्राक उपयोग करू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:473
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:477
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:482
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Turn sticky keys and slow keys off after a certain period of inactivity."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:489
#, kde-format
msgid " min"
msgstr "मि."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:491
#, kde-format
msgid "Timeout:"
msgstr "टाइम-आउटः"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:494
#, kde-format
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "अधिसूचना"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:502
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use the system bell whenever a gesture is used to turn an accessibility "
"feature on or off"
msgstr ""
"जखन कोनो एक्सेसिबिलिटी विशेषतासभ केँ चालू अथवा बन्न कएल जाए, तंत्र घंटी क' इस्तेमाल करू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:505
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is "
"turned on or off"
msgstr ""
"जखन कोनो कुंजीपट एक्सेसिबिलिटी विशेषतासभ केँ चालू अथवा बन्न कएल जाए, पुष्टिकरण समाद देखाबू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:507
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a "
"keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off.\n"
"Ensure you know what you are doing if you uncheck it, as the keyboard "
"accessibility settings will then always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:509
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a keyboard accessibility "
"feature is turned on or off"
msgstr ""
"जखन कोनो कुंजीपट अभिगम्यता विशेषतासभ केँ चालू अथवा बन्न कएल जाए, केडीई तंत्र सूचना सेवा "
"क' इस्तेमाल करू"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:558
#, kde-format
msgid "*.wav|WAV Files"
msgstr "*.wav|वेव फाइलसभ"
